  "text": "Hey listen, this is an important notice for the people of Rampur village. By 6 PM on August 17, 2030, everyone needs to head towards the school, got it? Everyone must bring two bottles of water with them. If you need a ride or something, just call 98765 43210. And yeah, you should only leave home after the river crosses the red mark, not before. Don't go through the market bridge at all, don't go that way."
